	'retreat_p1' => 'Twelve guests, one bell and a timetable you can read in a breath. Morning practice on the deck or in the hall, a walk in the forest, three plain meals at one long table, an hour of slow practice before supper. Between those, rest. Nobody asks you to choose a programme, a teacher or a treatment, and nothing else is on the schedule.',
